WEBVTT

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.170
Anne?

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.170
What are you doing here?

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.290
Oh! Looks like you cut your hair.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.340
Yeah...

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.290
Hey, Grea? Let's go shopping in town!

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.090
Huh?

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.000
Okay?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.790
But I don't have any clothes to wea-

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:39.780
Since you molted, the size of your
chest and stuff changed, right?

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.020
So I brought you this to wear!

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.420
Okay...

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.450
Mysteria Friends

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:04.000
Princess's Holiday

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:11.000
These are... supposed to be disguises, right?

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.250
I'm glad the clothes I 
brought look so good on you!

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.210
We have to go incognito for the day!

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.600
Actually, I think they're 
just making us stand out...

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.380
It's okay! No one will see through these!

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.290
Look, it's the princess!

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.540
Uh... Huh?

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:27.100
Are you going shopping?

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:30.360
Princess, Princess! Do some magic for us!
Hello, Princess. Lovely weather today.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.860
Princess! What are you out shopping for today?
Welcome back, Princess!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.080
I'm sorry they're bothering you, Princess.
Would you like to buy a flower, Princess?

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.000
Okay, okay. Everyone sure is energetic.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.920
Princess! Princess!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.040
Princess!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.210
Princess!

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.000
Yes, thank you.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.720
Well, they saw right through us.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.460
You really are a true princess, Anne.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.290
Huh? What's that mean?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.000
Okay, let's enjoy a full day of shopping!

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:04.960
Yeah.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:40.200
Oh! I found a mysterious 
alley for us to explore.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:43.170
Have you ever been down this way, Grea?

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.290
Nope, I haven't.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.380
It's kind of dreary around here.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:05.710
Yeah, it sure is.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.880
I don't see any people, either.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:12.130
Is there really nothing around here at all?

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.290
I wonder if that's another clothing store?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.460
Should we go inside and see?

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.510
Yeah, let's.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.790
Is this really a clothing store?

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.880
Maybe it's a workshop?

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.790
It looks like it might be...

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.920
What kind of clothes are these?

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:39.210
That top looks like sporting wear, but...

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:41.650
The bottom is part of a 
swimsuit, don't you think?

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.080
Welcome!

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:46.670
These are unique battle armors
from a land to the east that...

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.790
Oh my. Anne?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.710
M-Ms. Miranda?!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.330
You said, "Welcome"...

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.790
Does that mean this is YOUR store?!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:58.500
Uh, well, it's more of a way for me
to make a profit out of my hobby...

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.710
I suppose?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.800
Does our school even permit 
side jobs like this?

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.800
Huh?

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.830
F-feel free to take anything 
you'd like, on the house!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.250
Let's hurry.
Are you sure?

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:13.670
Of course, but in exchange...

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.710
Woo-hoo! Let's hurry and try all this stuff on, Grea!
Of course, but in exchange...

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.630
Woo-hoo! Let's hurry and try all this stuff on, Grea!
Make sure to keep this all a secret from the school!

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:17.920
Huh? W-wait a second...

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.190
This one is so cute!
Huh? W-wait a second...

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.250
Ta-da!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.000
How does this look?

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:28.200
Next, how about this?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.000
They look great on you!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.540
This is starting to be a lot of fun.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.670
How about you try something on next, Grea?

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.960
Um, no thanks. I...

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:41.170
Ms. Miranda, please pick out
an extra special cute one just for her!

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.470
She ran away.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.000
Oh my, oh my.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.960
Grea's playing hard to get.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.600
Wait a second...

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:05.210
How am I supposed to get this on?

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.690
Those are actually pajamas.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:24.460
I bet a sleepover with matching outfits
would be a lot of fun!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.750
"Matching"?

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.630
Did you get it on, Grea?

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.630
Grea...?

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.210
Please let us have this one, too!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.500
Okay! It's all yours!

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.670
It's so refreshing!

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:19.250
I knew it was worth waiting 
in line for these!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.380
That looks relaxing.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.880
It sure does.

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.500
Shall we take a ride?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.950
Hey, Anne?

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.080
Huh? Wh-what is it?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.750
Um, do boats make you uncomfortable?

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.590
N-no! That's not it!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.130
Please don't tell anyone.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:59.670
I've kept this a secret for all my life.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.580
The truth is, well...

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.200
I can't swim.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.000
Huh?

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:25.130
B-but by using magic I can float, dive,
and even walk on top of the water!

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:25.670
I think that's more impressive 
than being able to swim.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.290
It's just that I can't swim normally...
I think that's more impressive than being able to swim.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.460
It's just that I can't swim normally...

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.170
And well, um...

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.290
I see.

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.130
I didn't know that.

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:38.040
Huh?

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.210
Even you have something that
you're not good at, huh?

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:45.170
Well, nobody is perfect...

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:54.930
Um... thanks for today.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:55.880
Huh?

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.330
For choosing some clothes for me.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.250
No problem! It was fun for me, too.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.040
Um...

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:11.010
I'd like to come with you again.

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.710
Really?!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.460
Are you okay?

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.050
I-I'm fine.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.080
That's right!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.080
Ms. Miranda gave me some 
matching pajamas earlier.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.960
Could I...

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.680
come to your room sometime soon for a...

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.180
sleepover?

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:51.600
No.

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:52.540
Huh?!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.460
Why did she say no?

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:05.960
I really want to know.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:12.170
Why won't you let me, Grea?!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.830
When I was a child...

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:30.330
I picked up a bad habit 
that I just can't shake.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.080
I sleep like this.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:39.540
It's so embarrassing, I 
could never let Anne see.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 4
Test Time

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:40.630
Mysteria Friends, episode 4: "Test Time."

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.010
Illustration by Norio Tsukudani

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.920
Goodbye, Ms. Miranda!

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:51.920
Excellent work today!

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.080
Please be careful on your way home.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.110
Ms. Miranda.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.380
You're not heading home yet?

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.400
Not yet.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:04.290
It's almost time for tests,
and I have more class prep to do.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.380
Wow, you sound really busy.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.540
Is there anything we can help with?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.750
Nope, that's okay.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.290
Thanks anyway, see you again tomorrow.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.130
Okay then, goodbye.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.670
Please excuse us.

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.040
All righty then...

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.250
Time to let my passion go wild!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:45.630
Lately I haven't had any free time,
not even the chance to go to my shop!

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.500
But now I have a little time!

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.380
This feels amazing!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.750
I have to do something to keep my
overwhelming passion under control!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.710
Just a little bit, just for a while!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.680
They're... finished.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.710
Now, who to make wear them?

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.330
I think...

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:22.670
Ms. Miranda? Sorry, I forgot something.

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:23.500
Huh?

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.580
Anne...

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.170
Grea...
